WEBVTT

00:01.210 --> 00:03.070
<b>Miorine Rembran,</b>

00:03.070 --> 00:07.110
<b>I would like you
to take over the work of Quiet Zero.</b>

00:08.430 --> 00:12.000
<b>Hell no! I won't be
a substitute for my lousy father.</b>

00:12.000 --> 00:15.140
<b>Even if the originator was
Notrette Rembran?</b>

00:15.730 --> 00:17.590
<b>My mother...?</b>

00:17.590 --> 00:19.760
<b>How much do you know about data storms?</b>

00:20.860 --> 00:23.040
<b>That's the source
of the Gundam's curse, isn't it?</b>

00:23.530 --> 00:25.510
<b>For humans, at least.</b>

00:26.030 --> 00:29.850
<b>But one aspect of the phenomenon
is that it can form</b>

00:29.850 --> 00:33.440
<b>a hyper-dense information system
different from existing networks.</b>

00:34.050 --> 00:35.440
<b>Hyper-dense...?</b>

00:35.440 --> 00:37.620
<b>You've seen it with your own eyes.</b>

00:37.620 --> 00:41.610
<b>Time and again, you saw Aerial
override her opponents during duels...</b>

00:41.610 --> 00:43.240
<b>thanks to the same phenomenon.</b>

00:43.670 --> 00:46.310
<b>So then Quiet Zero is...</b>

00:46.720 --> 00:49.080
<b>A radical new network concept</b>

00:49.080 --> 00:54.670
<b>that can use data storms
to control any system via Permet links.</b>

00:55.100 --> 00:58.300
<b>Aerial is the trigger
that will activate it.</b>

00:58.300 --> 00:59.710
<b>What the heck is that?</b>

00:59.710 --> 01:02.380
<b>Does my lousy father want
to become a god or something?</b>

01:02.730 --> 01:06.460
<b>Indeed. A most arrogant god.</b>

01:07.030 --> 01:10.210
<b>However, I sympathized with his aims.</b>

01:10.620 --> 01:14.190
<b>A world without the sadness
of conflict or loss.</b>

01:15.160 --> 01:18.190
<b>I decided to give
the President my assistance.</b>

01:18.500 --> 01:22.260
<b>That's why I sent Suletta to your school
and let her participate in duels.</b>

01:22.670 --> 01:24.740
<b>I knew it! You're using Suletta for--</b>

01:24.740 --> 01:27.910
<b>The child dreamed of going to school.</b>

01:28.340 --> 01:31.070
<b>As a parent, I've made
every effort to realize that.</b>

01:32.100 --> 01:36.280
<b>And as long as she fights in duels,
there's no worry she'll be killed.</b>

01:36.980 --> 01:41.670
<b>The Asticassia School was the best
environment for Aerial's optimization.</b>

01:42.110 --> 01:43.410
<b>Things were going smoothly.</b>

01:44.110 --> 01:46.960
<b>Until the plant was attacked, that is.</b>

01:47.650 --> 01:51.830
<b>Unless the President awakens,
we cannot proceed with Quiet Zero.</b>

01:51.830 --> 01:56.020
<b>Worse, if the Group finds out,
the plan could even be shelved.</b>

01:56.410 --> 01:58.970
<b>Aren't you afraid
I might leak all this?</b>

01:59.420 --> 02:03.390
<b>I'm confident you wouldn't
since you haven't tried to escape here.</b>

02:04.460 --> 02:06.980
<b>We can't allow your father's
greatest wish to be thwarted.</b>

02:07.880 --> 02:09.530
<b>Can we?</b>

02:08.910 --> 02:10.980
<b>Episode 14</b>

03:43.690 --> 03:45.380
<b>GUND medical treatment?</b>

03:46.370 --> 03:50.500
<b>How about some nutritious goat's milk?</b>

03:52.490 --> 03:55.470
<b>I told you goat's milk wouldn't sell.</b>

03:55.470 --> 03:57.100
<b>They don't know what they're missing.</b>

03:57.100 --> 03:57.960
<b>Done!</b>

03:58.410 --> 04:00.190
<b>Is it for her wounds?</b>

04:00.190 --> 04:02.900
<b>She'll at least let us
do first aid, right?</b>

04:02.900 --> 04:07.440
<b>She should've just told us
she had an accident working on Pharact.</b>

04:07.440 --> 04:11.270
<b>Nika's always kept things from us.</b>

04:11.970 --> 04:14.910
<b>She's told us nothing about herself.</b>

04:18.850 --> 04:20.530
<b>Do you mind if I ask...</b>

04:21.010 --> 04:23.710
<b>what happened between you,
Ms. Sophie, and Ms. Norea?</b>

04:24.560 --> 04:28.580
<b>If I tell you,
I'll only bring more trouble on you.</b>

04:29.020 --> 04:31.190
<b>I've brought it on you, too.</b>

04:31.190 --> 04:32.540
<b>Trouble...</b>

04:32.950 --> 04:34.260
<b>That's why...</b>

04:35.030 --> 04:37.000
<b>I'm an orphan like them.</b>

04:37.740 --> 04:41.040
<b>I don't know my own parents
or where I was born.</b>

04:41.040 --> 04:45.880
<b>Stuck in a tiny room, I spent every day
assembling different components.</b>

04:47.000 --> 04:50.380
<b>I'd always longed to go to school.</b>

04:50.380 --> 04:52.780
<b>So when they told me
I could go to Asticassia,</b>

04:52.780 --> 04:54.520
<b>I was really happy.</b>

04:55.300 --> 04:57.660
<b>It felt like my dream had come true.</b>

04:59.180 --> 05:02.600
<b>When you told me
it was your first time attending school,</b>

05:02.600 --> 05:05.650
<b>I thought you were just like me.</b>

05:06.600 --> 05:09.910
<b>I was just projecting myself onto you,
Suletta.</b>

05:09.910 --> 05:11.160
<b>That's all.</b>

05:11.370 --> 05:12.690
<b>Ms. Nika...</b>

05:12.690 --> 05:13.680
<b>It's fine.</b>

05:13.990 --> 05:15.910
<b>I'll take care of everything myself.</b>

05:16.360 --> 05:18.100
<b>Suletta, you have to...</b>

05:18.490 --> 05:20.350
<b>continue enjoying school.</b>

05:25.660 --> 05:26.940
<b>Suletta!</b>

05:27.550 --> 05:29.150
<b>Mr. Elan?</b>

05:29.150 --> 05:31.280
<b>It's finally just the two of us.</b>

05:31.280 --> 05:35.070
<b>I-I have to go
help with the event booth...</b>

05:35.070 --> 05:36.370
<b>Don't worry about that.</b>

05:36.370 --> 05:38.120
<b>More importantly...</b>

05:38.120 --> 05:41.820
<b>I have to find out why you're avoiding me.</b>

05:42.270 --> 05:45.140
<b>You're the one who changed
my solitary life,</b>

05:45.140 --> 05:48.280
<b>and you also said
you wanted to know more about me.</b>

05:48.280 --> 05:49.370
<b>So...</b>

05:49.770 --> 05:54.370
<b>now I'd like you to give me a real sign
of your affection.</b>

05:55.830 --> 05:57.140
<b>Big Sis!</b>

05:57.140 --> 05:58.680
<b>Let's go there next!</b>

05:58.680 --> 06:00.470
<b>M-Ms. Sophie, wait!</b>

06:00.470 --> 06:01.590
<b>No way!</b>

06:04.160 --> 06:07.360
<b>Too bad. You couldn't win her over.</b>

06:07.360 --> 06:09.590
<b>Well, there's always next time.</b>

06:10.250 --> 06:13.310
<b>Can a Gundam pilot
really count on a "next time"?</b>

06:14.340 --> 06:18.830
<b>Peil Technologies has you on a leash,
idling your life away in a toy garden.</b>

06:18.830 --> 06:20.240
<b>It's hard not to laugh.</b>

06:20.840 --> 06:22.290
<b>Those eyes of yours...</b>

06:22.290 --> 06:24.400
<b>They remind me of someone I used to know.</b>

06:25.060 --> 06:30.210
<b>A pitiful guy who couldn't even
choose whether he'd live or die.</b>

06:30.600 --> 06:33.130
<b>I heard he ended up dying all alone.</b>

06:33.690 --> 06:35.300
<b>You're an irritating fellow.</b>

06:35.300 --> 06:37.800
<b>You're pretty annoying yourself!</b>

06:38.410 --> 06:40.350
<b>He was bothering you, wasn't he?</b>

06:40.350 --> 06:42.270
<b>That guy grosses me out.</b>

06:42.270 --> 06:44.850
<b>Mr. Elan isn't gross...</b>

06:44.850 --> 06:46.090
<b>I've decided.</b>

06:46.700 --> 06:48.820
<b>My stake in the duel...</b>

06:48.820 --> 06:52.090
<b>If I win, you'll become
my real big sister.</b>

06:52.490 --> 06:53.450
<b>"Real"?</b>

06:53.450 --> 06:54.320
<b>That's right.</b>

06:54.320 --> 06:57.090
<b>We'll become a real family.</b>

06:57.090 --> 06:59.810
<b>Do that, and I'll refrain
from killing her, too.</b>

07:00.970 --> 07:04.500
<b>I'm sorry, but... I have a bride.</b>

07:04.500 --> 07:05.910
<b>A bride?</b>

07:05.910 --> 07:08.290
<b>I made a promise to Ms. Miorine.</b>

07:08.290 --> 07:11.660
<b>I'll stay at her side
and I'll never lose a duel.</b>

07:12.100 --> 07:15.200
<b>So I have no choice... but to win.</b>

07:16.270 --> 07:18.760
<b>Miorine... Miorine Rembran?</b>

07:18.760 --> 07:22.600
<b>Delling's daughter,
and the president of GUND-ARM, Inc.</b>

07:23.160 --> 07:26.840
<b>I get it. Miorine's the one
who keeps you confined.</b>

07:27.620 --> 07:31.630
<b>If I kill Miorine, can I once again
see you like you were before?</b>

07:31.630 --> 07:32.940
<b>What do you mean...?</b>

07:35.130 --> 07:37.110
<b>This is the Dueling Committee.</b>

07:37.110 --> 07:39.760
<b>Students participating
in the Rumble Ring...</b>

07:38.860 --> 07:41.070
<b>I look forward to our duel.</b>

07:39.760 --> 07:42.310
<b>...report to the 9th tactical testing sector.</b>

07:41.520 --> 07:44.580
<b>Wait! The dueling vow!</b>

07:42.890 --> 07:46.690
<b>All students participating
in the Rumble Ring...</b>

07:47.140 --> 07:50.880
<b>We will now begin
our Open Campus special event,</b>

07:50.880 --> 07:53.420
<b>the Rumble Ring!</b>

07:53.420 --> 07:56.090
<b>The format will be
a battle royal-style duel.</b>

07:56.090 --> 07:58.010
<b>The time limit is 30 minutes.</b>

07:58.010 --> 08:01.720
<b>When a contestant's blade antenna
is broken, they're eliminated,</b>

08:01.720 --> 08:04.720
<b>and the last pilot standing
will be the victor.</b>

08:04.720 --> 08:06.770
<b>Participation is open to all.</b>

08:06.770 --> 08:11.310
<b>It's an exhibition, after all...
so you won't be dishonored if you lose!</b>

08:11.310 --> 08:16.530
<b>As of tomorrow, I'll officially become
CEO of Jeturk Heavy Industries.</b>

08:16.530 --> 08:18.570
<b>My campus life ends here.</b>

08:18.570 --> 08:20.990
<b>But before that happens...</b>

08:20.990 --> 08:25.330
<b>we'll crush the Mercurian wench
who humiliated us and my brother!</b>

08:25.330 --> 08:26.520
<b>Yeah!</b>

08:26.520 --> 08:28.660
<b>Let's do it!</b>

08:29.050 --> 08:33.040
<b>I've made sure your Dilanza
is in perfect condition, sir.</b>

08:33.600 --> 08:35.160
<b>You can fight with all its strength!</b>

08:35.390 --> 08:37.030
<b>Thank you, Petra.</b>

08:37.030 --> 08:37.880
<b>Huh?</b>

08:38.490 --> 08:42.480
<b>Pilots, board your mobile suits...</b>

08:41.200 --> 08:43.010
<b>Renee, don't go off on your own.</b>

08:43.010 --> 08:44.720
<b>Who do you think I am?</b>

08:45.280 --> 08:47.850
<b>What about Nika and the transfer students?</b>

08:47.850 --> 08:50.350
<b>There's no time.
Focus on the task at hand.</b>

08:50.350 --> 08:52.990
<b>Container launch preparations complete!</b>

08:52.990 --> 08:54.060
<b>Here we go!</b>

08:54.060 --> 08:55.860
<b>We're counting on you, Elan!</b>

08:55.860 --> 08:58.900
<b>This is a chance
to publicize GUND-ARM, Inc.!</b>

08:58.900 --> 09:00.660
<b>Give it all you've got!</b>

09:00.660 --> 09:03.560
<b>I could die
from giving it my all, you know...</b>

09:04.170 --> 09:06.830
<b>What did she mean by "like I was before"?</b>

09:07.390 --> 09:09.700
<b>And about killing Ms. Miorine?</b>

09:10.890 --> 09:12.350
<b>Right.</b>

09:12.350 --> 09:14.820
<b>If I win, I can save Ms. Nika.</b>

09:14.820 --> 09:17.210
<b>And then I can talk to Ms. Sophie, too.</b>

09:20.030 --> 09:24.180
<b>As witness, we are joined
by the CEO of Grassley Defense Systems,</b>

09:24.180 --> 09:27.010
<b>President Sarius Zenelli.</b>

09:27.010 --> 09:30.500
<b>Who ever thought...
I'd be Delling's surrogate?</b>

09:31.840 --> 09:34.650
<b>KP014, Sabina Fardin.</b>

09:34.650 --> 09:37.440
<b>LP013, Renee Costa.</b>

09:37.440 --> 09:39.570
<b>Heindree... let's go!</b>

09:43.930 --> 09:46.410
<b>LP017, Felsi Rollo.</b>

09:46.410 --> 09:49.100
<b>KP013, Lauda Neill.</b>

09:49.600 --> 09:51.940
<b>Dilanza... moving out!</b>

09:54.140 --> 09:58.130
<b>MP039, Chuatury Panlunch. Demi Trainer.</b>

09:58.130 --> 10:02.130
<b>KP002, Elan Ceres. Pharact.</b>

10:02.130 --> 10:05.090
<b>LP041, Suletta Mercury...</b>

10:05.090 --> 10:07.160
<b>Aerial, taking off!</b>

10:10.870 --> 10:14.090
<b>What did you want to discuss, Bel?</b>

10:14.660 --> 10:16.610
<b>Where did Ms. Sophie...</b>

10:16.610 --> 10:17.480
<b>Suletta!</b>

10:17.480 --> 10:18.810
<b>The mock battle's starting.</b>

10:18.810 --> 10:19.760
<b>R-Right!</b>

10:20.240 --> 10:23.180
<b>Let the Rumble Ring... start!</b>

10:21.300 --> 10:23.180
<b>9th Tactical Testing Sector</b>

10:26.300 --> 10:28.370
<b>Fight together until the Holder falls!</b>

10:28.370 --> 10:28.830
<b>Right!</b>

10:28.830 --> 10:30.490
<b>No double-crossing!</b>

10:36.650 --> 10:37.670
<b>Mr. Elan?</b>

10:37.670 --> 10:40.000
<b>I'll exterminate
these pesky insects for you.</b>

10:40.000 --> 10:43.960
<b>How about a little reward,
like some private time for the two of us?</b>

10:45.620 --> 10:48.090
<b>Our priority is taking out
the Aerial and Pharact!</b>

10:48.090 --> 10:48.790
<b>Copy that!</b>

10:59.970 --> 11:01.090
<b>How scary.</b>

11:01.750 --> 11:02.820
<b>Back me up, please.</b>

11:02.820 --> 11:04.490
<b>Huh?! Whoa!</b>

11:04.490 --> 11:06.320
<b>You're in my way! Move!</b>

11:07.710 --> 11:08.740
<b>Damn you!</b>

11:08.740 --> 11:12.850
<b>Time to pay you back
for busting up my Demi Tray!</b>

11:18.280 --> 11:21.030
<b>Is Chuchu feeling okay?</b>

11:25.610 --> 11:28.550
<b>Get ready for our revenge match, Gundam!</b>

11:36.330 --> 11:37.890
<b>Lauda Neill!</b>

11:37.890 --> 11:40.150
<b>Who said you could butt in?!</b>

11:42.380 --> 11:43.890
<b>You're mine!</b>

11:43.890 --> 11:46.510
<b>You think you can keep up with me?</b>

11:52.690 --> 11:54.870
<b>Everything's gone wrong
since you showed up.</b>

11:54.870 --> 11:56.360
<b>Everything...</b>

11:56.360 --> 11:58.290
<b>Every last bit of it!</b>

11:58.290 --> 12:02.490
<b>Do you understand
what you've done, Mercurian wench?!</b>

12:15.490 --> 12:16.790
<b>Mr. Lauda!</b>

12:16.790 --> 12:18.920
<b>That mobile suit...</b>

12:21.910 --> 12:24.360
<b>Lfrith Ur, Lfrith Thorn...</b>

12:24.360 --> 12:26.190
<b>Beginning operation.</b>

12:26.190 --> 12:27.010
<b>Those are...</b>

12:27.010 --> 12:28.600
<b>The mobile suits from Plant Quetta.</b>

12:28.600 --> 12:30.350
<b>Why are those terrorists here?!</b>

12:30.760 --> 12:33.380
<b>Don't tell me... Nika!</b>

12:33.380 --> 12:35.490
<b>Is this the front management company?</b>

12:35.490 --> 12:37.620
<b>I have a confession to make.</b>

12:38.800 --> 12:40.110
<b>I've...</b>

12:40.970 --> 12:42.080
<b>That won't do.</b>

12:42.080 --> 12:44.860
<b>You can't act selfishly
behind Shaddiq's back.</b>

12:47.020 --> 12:49.240
<b>Ms. Sophie?</b>

12:49.650 --> 12:52.840
<b>Now then, let's have our duel...</b>

12:53.190 --> 12:54.550
<b>Big Sis.</b>

12:57.130 --> 12:59.460
<b>Sir! Mr. Lauda!</b>

13:00.200 --> 13:03.150
<b>Ms. Sophie... pilots that Gundam?</b>

13:03.670 --> 13:05.230
<b>Sophie?</b>

13:05.230 --> 13:07.180
<b>Looks like the other is Norea Du Noc...</b>

13:07.180 --> 13:10.060
<b>Come on, let's finish
what we started then.</b>

13:10.060 --> 13:13.020
<b>Each of us in our violent machines!</b>

13:21.390 --> 13:23.240
<b>Huh? What the...</b>

13:23.240 --> 13:24.990
<b>The outer wall is...</b>

13:24.990 --> 13:25.850
<b>Haro?</b>

13:25.850 --> 13:27.820
<b>Beam output beyond legal limit.</b>

13:28.310 --> 13:31.130
<b>Front's protection mechanisms
cannot counteract.</b>

13:31.870 --> 13:34.660
<b>You bastard!
How dare you butt in so rudely?!</b>

13:36.750 --> 13:39.790
<b>And what about you?
How could an Earthian be so sloppy?!</b>

13:42.340 --> 13:44.670
<b>Why would you aim for the cockpit?!</b>

13:44.670 --> 13:49.180
<b>Those two don't have the campus
regulation program installed.</b>

13:49.180 --> 13:50.500
<b>They're prepared for real combat.</b>

13:50.500 --> 13:51.280
<b>Huh?</b>

13:51.280 --> 13:54.640
<b>The front management
company hasn't come yet. Why not?</b>

13:55.970 --> 13:57.450
<b>This is an emergency announcement.</b>

13:57.450 --> 13:59.350
<b>The Rumble Ring is hereby canceled!</b>

13:59.350 --> 14:01.870
<b>Everyone in tactical testing sector,
evacuate immediately!</b>

14:01.870 --> 14:02.580
<b>What's going on?</b>

14:02.580 --> 14:03.960
<b>How should I know?!</b>

14:05.110 --> 14:08.450
<b>All you Spacians... are going to die!</b>

14:26.260 --> 14:28.880
<b>No!</b>

14:27.190 --> 14:28.880
<b>Suletta! Chuchu! Run!</b>

14:28.880 --> 14:30.150
<b>Now!</b>

14:30.640 --> 14:32.990
<b>Look at you, showing off...</b>

14:32.990 --> 14:35.150
<b>We don't have much time. Let's move.</b>

14:35.150 --> 14:37.230
<b>I'll use two of them for the duel.</b>

14:37.800 --> 14:40.000
<b>Permet score... three!</b>

14:40.000 --> 14:42.230
<b>Permet score three.</b>

14:57.580 --> 14:58.580
<b>Reinforcements?</b>

14:58.580 --> 15:01.880
<b>This time, I brought GUND-Bits of my own.</b>

15:01.880 --> 15:04.730
<b>Let 'er rip, Gundvolvas!</b>

15:16.850 --> 15:19.770
<b>No lifeform readings. Unmanned machines?</b>

15:20.670 --> 15:22.770
<b>No one told me about those things!</b>

15:22.770 --> 15:26.080
<b>Confirming launch
of GUND-Bits. Let's begin.</b>

15:26.080 --> 15:29.270
<b>I'm terrible at acting, though!</b>

15:29.270 --> 15:31.340
<b>Why haven't we evacuated?</b>

15:31.340 --> 15:34.170
<b>This vehicle was damaged
in that last attack.</b>

15:34.170 --> 15:35.490
<b>President Sarius!</b>

15:35.490 --> 15:39.580
<b>We're arranging a backup vehicle.
Please be patient a little longer.</b>

15:40.140 --> 15:43.420
<b>Pretending to be losing like this
is stressing me out.</b>

15:47.920 --> 15:51.610
<b>Come on, now.
You wanted a duel, didn't you?</b>

15:51.610 --> 15:53.940
<b>Fire at me some more!</b>

15:53.940 --> 15:55.720
<b>Stop this, please! Everyone will die!</b>

15:55.720 --> 15:58.570
<b>If you pilot a mobile suit,
people will die!</b>

15:58.570 --> 16:00.480
<b>Didn't they teach you that at school?</b>

16:00.480 --> 16:02.600
<b>Why use Gundams so wickedly?!</b>

16:02.600 --> 16:05.360
<b>Because there are things I want!</b>

16:10.150 --> 16:11.960
<b>Things you want?</b>

16:11.960 --> 16:13.820
<b>Meals big enough to fill my stomach...</b>

16:13.820 --> 16:17.090
<b>A fluffy bed to sleep on, warm showers!</b>

16:17.090 --> 16:18.420
<b>There's still more!</b>

16:18.420 --> 16:21.330
<b>Comics, video games, and also...</b>

16:21.330 --> 16:23.790
<b>a family who will always love me!</b>

16:23.790 --> 16:27.960
<b>This is wrong!
You can't kill others for...</b>

16:35.620 --> 16:36.890
<b>I'll never forgive you.</b>

16:36.890 --> 16:40.020
<b>If that's how you want it,
I'll just have to...</b>

16:40.020 --> 16:42.270
<b>...kill you all myself!</b>

16:42.710 --> 16:44.040
<b>Someone!</b>

16:44.040 --> 16:46.060
<b>He's dying!</b>

16:46.060 --> 16:49.450
<b>Mr. Lauda's going to die!</b>

16:52.560 --> 16:55.910
<b>Go whine somewhere else,
you damn Spacian!</b>

16:57.150 --> 17:01.080
<b>Raise your Permet score,
or you'll die next, Elen Ceres!</b>

17:01.080 --> 17:02.290
<b>You must be kidding.</b>

17:02.290 --> 17:07.760
<b>I changed my face just to stay alive.
There's no way I'm dying in vain.</b>

17:10.660 --> 17:13.800
<b>If you're afraid to die,
ditch your Gundam!</b>

17:21.130 --> 17:22.020
<b>You took too long!</b>

17:22.020 --> 17:25.890
<b>Get the President to a secure... location.</b>

17:27.220 --> 17:28.540
<b>What are you...?</b>

17:28.540 --> 17:30.830
<b>Forgive us, sir. We have to detain you.</b>

17:30.830 --> 17:32.460
<b>Shaddiq is waiting to see you,</b>

17:32.460 --> 17:33.990
<b>Mr. President!</b>

17:33.990 --> 17:35.280
<b>What's the meaning of all this?</b>

17:36.020 --> 17:37.450
<b>Shaddiq!</b>

17:40.060 --> 17:43.660
<b>Thank you for taking me
under your wing, Sarius Zenelli.</b>

17:43.660 --> 17:45.090
<b>The operation is over.</b>

17:45.090 --> 17:47.040
<b>Let's get out of here, Sophie.</b>

17:48.360 --> 17:48.960
<b>Damn it...</b>

17:50.710 --> 17:52.460
<b>She backed off? Why?</b>

17:56.660 --> 17:57.880
<b>I see...</b>

17:59.880 --> 18:02.190
<b>You must have them too,
Big Sister Suletta!</b>

18:02.190 --> 18:04.850
<b>Things you want!
Things you'll fight to win!</b>

18:04.850 --> 18:06.760
<b>Is it that bride of yours?</b>

18:06.760 --> 18:08.270
<b>That woman Miorine?</b>

18:08.270 --> 18:12.110
<b>You pilot that tool of murder for her?</b>

18:14.030 --> 18:16.530
<b>Aerial is not a tool of murder!</b>

18:16.530 --> 18:20.130
<b>Then why does Aerial have those weapons?</b>

18:20.130 --> 18:23.200
<b>Who made it such a violent machine?</b>

18:24.980 --> 18:27.180
<b>A-Aerial was built by my mom to...</b>

18:27.180 --> 18:28.160
<b>By my mom to...</b>

18:29.280 --> 18:30.640
<b>To do what?</b>

18:37.080 --> 18:39.190
<b>I'll win the duel!</b>

18:39.190 --> 18:42.230
<b>I'll crush Miorine, the school,
and everything else...</b>

18:42.230 --> 18:45.680
<b>and then I'll let you
be my family, Big Sis!</b>

18:54.610 --> 18:55.710
<b>Sophie!</b>

18:55.710 --> 18:57.610
<b>Norea, stay back!</b>

18:59.280 --> 19:02.070
<b>I can't control them.
She's taken over the Gundvolvas?</b>

19:04.830 --> 19:06.660
<b>Now I see.</b>

19:06.660 --> 19:08.140
<b>So that's it...</b>

19:11.830 --> 19:14.430
<b>Sophie, you can't go any further!</b>

19:14.430 --> 19:15.770
<b>I hear it.</b>

19:16.290 --> 19:19.440
<b>I can feel it! The thrill from that day!</b>

19:19.440 --> 19:22.900
<b>That beautiful voice
calling out to kill me!</b>

19:24.080 --> 19:26.140
<b>Aerial's true nature?</b>

19:26.140 --> 19:29.740
<b>With its eleven GUND-Bits,</b>

19:29.740 --> 19:34.110
<b>Aerial's been controlling space itself
using the data storm.</b>

19:34.850 --> 19:39.170
<b>And yet Suletta
is unaffected by the data storm.</b>

19:39.490 --> 19:43.590
<b>Almost as if someone else
were controlling the GUND-Bits.</b>

19:44.100 --> 19:45.990
<b>Why don't you just say it?</b>

19:47.860 --> 19:51.180
<b>You had another daughter.</b>

19:51.570 --> 19:54.810
<b>Where is Ericht Samaya now?</b>

19:55.620 --> 19:56.920
<b>She's there.</b>

19:58.490 --> 20:00.920
<b>Right at Suletta's side.</b>

20:01.830 --> 20:03.930
<b>No! Aerial, stop!</b>

20:05.830 --> 20:08.890
<b>Suletta! It wasn't you!</b>

20:12.550 --> 20:16.290
<b>The one I wanted...</b>

20:19.940 --> 20:22.990
<b>Stop it!</b>

20:29.650 --> 20:31.870
<b>Beyond the data storm...</b>

20:32.860 --> 20:35.060
<b>she's there waiting for us.</b>

20:37.570 --> 20:39.430
<b>It can't be...</b>

20:39.430 --> 20:42.690
<b>you turned a human into a mobile suit...</b>

20:43.710 --> 20:46.650
<b>She's gained a new body.</b>

20:47.170 --> 20:48.690
<b>Be glad for her.</b>

20:49.040 --> 20:53.450
<b>Eri herself is the future of GUND
that we've been searching for.</b>

20:56.640 --> 20:58.640
<b>Quiet Zero?</b>

20:58.640 --> 21:01.820
<b>A project conceived by Delling Rembran.</b>

21:01.820 --> 21:05.350
<b>We'll use the GUND Format
to eliminate war and conflict.</b>

21:05.350 --> 21:06.630
<b>Lovely, isn't it?</b>

21:06.980 --> 21:10.290
<b>Please tell me your true intentions.</b>

21:11.570 --> 21:17.350
<b>You wouldn't need a Permet score that high
just to realize the President's plan.</b>

21:18.200 --> 21:20.550
<b>I want to rewrite the world.</b>

21:21.120 --> 21:22.510
<b>For what purpose?</b>

21:22.510 --> 21:25.360
<b>So that Eri can be happy.</b>

21:26.330 --> 21:27.340
<b>Ms. Sophie!</b>

21:34.460 --> 21:36.910
<b>It's nothing to fret about.</b>

21:37.900 --> 21:41.290
<b>Sophie died
before you could kill her.</b>

21:42.010 --> 21:45.710
<b>I, too, will one day be killed
by the Gundam's curse.</b>

21:46.810 --> 21:50.710
<b>And yet you weren't killed by it.
What the hell are you?</b>

21:53.580 --> 21:55.710
<b>This is your last chance to surrender!</b>

21:54.390 --> 21:55.710
<b>No kidding!</b>

21:55.710 --> 21:58.640
<b>Visibly disarm yourself...</b>

21:55.930 --> 21:57.770
<b>Sophie and Norea were...?!</b>

21:58.640 --> 22:00.960
<b>...follow our instructions...</b>

21:59.250 --> 22:00.960
<b>Where is Nika Nanaura?</b>

22:00.960 --> 22:04.560
<b>...and exit your cockpit.</b>

22:01.930 --> 22:04.320
<b>She's being arrested as a terrorist!</b>

22:05.370 --> 22:08.220
<b>You Earth House students are coming too.</b>

22:08.220 --> 22:09.770
<b>What?</b>

22:12.340 --> 22:15.430
<b>What Ms. Sophie said must be wrong.</b>

22:15.430 --> 22:20.990
<b>Gundams are supposed
to be mobile suits that save lives.</b>

22:24.810 --> 22:26.290
<b>That's right.</b>

22:27.350 --> 22:31.250
<b>I protected Ms. Nika,
Ms. Miorine, and the campus, too.</b>

22:31.730 --> 22:34.300
<b>You and the others
helped me along, Aerial.</b>

22:36.280 --> 22:38.250
<b>Move forward, gain two...</b>

22:39.150 --> 22:41.140
<b>Just like Mom says!</b>

23:53.970 --> 24:02.000
<b>Episode 15</b>

23:54.560 --> 23:58.260
<b>Next time on
Mobile Suit Gundam: The Witch from Mercury</b>

23:58.260 --> 23:59.630
<b>"Father and Child."</b>

24:02.000 --> 24:07.250
<b>Illustration: lack</b>
